<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baker Hughes upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Baker Hughes Inc to outperform from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Baker Hughes gained 1-1/2 to 38-1/8 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
